{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, in the far edge of the galaxy, lies Octopa \u2014 a tiny planet with only two things: strange creatures and something they call \u201cYasai.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, the people of Octopa have piled up a massive debt they can\u2019t repay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So they have summoned you to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn money, you\u2019ll need vegetables that can be sold to humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture and raise odd creatures, grow Yasai on the farm, and work toward clearing the debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the coins you earn to unlock skills and improve efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy more eggs with Love, expand your farm, and watch the creatures go about their charming little lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, leave the game running, or just enjoy watching their world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Octopa is counting on you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138740?t=1762506486","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4138740?t=1762506486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/d87ce821e90ab8eec46702d937f13c61e51fce16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762506486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/d87ce821e90ab8eec46702d937f13c61e51fce16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762506486","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, in the far edge of the galaxy, lies Octopa \u2014 a tiny planet with only two things: strange creatures and something they call \u201cYasai.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, the people of Octopa have piled up a massive debt they can\u2019t repay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So they have summoned you to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To earn money, you\u2019ll need vegetables that can be sold to humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture and raise odd creatures, grow Yasai on the farm, and work toward clearing the debt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the coins you earn to unlock skills and improve efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy more eggs with Love, expand your farm, and watch the creatures go about their charming little lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, leave the game running, or just enjoy watching their world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Octopa is counting on you.</p>","developers":["\u96fb\u8133\u9234\u6728\u7d44"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4138740/9e50c359cd49a1268172206c19953036e8b9670f/header.jpg?t=1762506486","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 12 (Monterey) ~<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 / Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Apple M1 integrated GPU / Intel Iris Plus (Metal support required)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Runs as a persistent desktop environment.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 14 (Sonom